<title>JAPAN: Tokyo stock market closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Tokyo stock market closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tokyo stock market was closed for a holiday Monday, with trading to resume on Tuesday.</p>
<p>On Friday, the Nikkei 225 index gained 166.20 points, or 0.81 percent, to end at 20,633,06.</p>
